# Title: Abusing Print Executable
# ID: bafac3d6-7de9-4dd9-8874-4a1194b493ed
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Furkan CALISKAN, @caliskanfurkan_, @oscd_initiative
# Date: 2020-10-05
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
# Description: Attackers can use print.exe for remote file copy
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\print.exe" AND process_exec="print*" AND (process_exec="*/D*" AND process_exec="*.exe*")) AND NOT ((process_exec="*print.exe*")))
